{"id":"e_conomique","lemma":"économique","pos":"adj","rank":4270,"glosses":["economy; economic","economic (frugal)"],"ipa":"/e.kɔ.nɔ.mik/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5e/Fr-%C3%A9conomique.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9conomique.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"économiques"},"formAudio":{"économiques":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/28/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-%C3%A9conomiques.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La situation économique empira.","en":"The economic situation grew worse.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"situation"},null,{"g":"to worsen","l":"empirer"}]},{"text":"Cette voiture est très économique en essence.","en":"This car is very economical on gas.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"car"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"essence"}]},{"text":"Le pays est en mauvaise posture économique.","en":"The country is in a bad economic state.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"land"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"bad","l":"mauvais"},{"g":"posture, attitude"},null]},{"text":"Une petite voiture est plus économique qu'une grande.","en":"A small car is more economical than a large one.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"small, little","l":"petit"},{"g":"car"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"more / no longer"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"big","l":"grand"}]},{"text":"Nous avons étudié la politique économique du gouvernement.","en":"We studied the government's economic policy.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to study","l":"étudier"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"politics"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"government"}]}]}